{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26190","headline":"赠友人古镜 · 朱昼","name":"赠友人古镜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我有古时镜，初自坏陵得。\n蛟龙犹泥蟠，魑魅幸月蚀。\n摩久见菱蘂，青於蓝水色。\n赠君将照色，无使心受惑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱昼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26190.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26190","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}